              </div>

              <div class="node">
                <strong>Node 3</strong>
                <span>Raspberry Pi 5</span>
                <small>Raspberry Pi OS</small>
                <small>VPN &amp; Reverse Proxy</small>
                <small>NAS Backup Copy</small>
              </div>

            </div>

          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="hardware">
          <h2>Hardware</h2>

          <p>
            The infrastructure is distributed across three physical machines,
            each serving a different role based on its compute, storage and
            networking capabilities.
          </p>

